receiving SOC antibiotic therapy against C. difficile.", "date": "2019-06-19", "last_updated": "2026-10-02"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "LMN-201 for Prevention of C. Difficile ... | NCT05330182 ...", "url": "https://deltatrials.com/trial/NCT05330182", "domain": "deltatrials.com", "snippet": "Recruiting PHASE2/PHASE3 INTERVENTIONAL 3-arm NCT05330182\n# LMN-201 for Prevention of C. Difficile Infection Recurrence\nA Phase 2, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Study of LMN-201 for Prevention of C.\nDifficile Infection Recurrence\nSponsor: Congressionally Directed Medical Research Programs\nConditions Clostridioides Difficile Infection\n...\nUpdated 18 times since 2022 Last updated: Feb 9, 2026 Started: Aug 29, 2024 Primary completion: Jun 1, 2027 Completion: Dec 1, 2027\n...\nA PHASE2/PHASE3 clinical study on Clostridioides Difficile Infection, this trial is actively recruiting participants.\nThe trial is conducted by Congressionally Directed Medical Research Programs and has accumulated 18 data snapshots since 2024.\n...\n18 versions recorded\n1. Feb 2026 — Present [monthly]\nRecruiting PHASE2/PHASE3\n...\nSponsor contact: - Congressionally Directed Medical Research Programs\n- Lumen Bioscience, Inc.", "date": "2026-02-01", "last_updated": "2026-09-12"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "LMN-201 - MedPath", "url": "https://trial.medpath.com/drug/b7926ed2b4ecf585/lmn-201", "domain": "trial.medpath.com", "snippet": "## Clinical Trials\n|Title|Posted|Study ID|Phase|Status|Sponsor|\n|--|--|--|--|--|--|\n|LMN-201 for Prevention of C.\nDifficile Infection Recurrence|2022/04/15|NCT05330182|Phase 2|Recruiting|Lumen Bioscience, Inc.|\n## FDA Drug Approvals\n|Approved Product|Manufacturer|NDC Code|Route|Strength|Effective Date|\n|--|--|--|--|--|--|\n|No FDA approvals found for this drug.|\n## EMA Drug Approvals\n|Approved Product|Authorization Holder|Status|Issued Date|\n|--|--|--|--|\n|No EMA approvals found for this drug.|\n## HSA Drug Approv