{"row_id": "q019", "objective": "Innovent Biologics Inc. descriptions of IBI-3001's advantage over existing treatments for Head and Neck Squamous Cell Carcinoma in investor materials, earnings calls, investor day presentations, and press releases", "anchors": ["IBI-3001"], "mode": "queries", "case_id": "q019-1", "query": "IBI-3001 HNSCC investor presentation treatment advantage", "repeat": 0, "provider": "perplexity", "request": {"query": "IBI-3001 HNSCC investor presentation treatment advantage", "search_type": "fast", "max_results": 10}, "ok": true, "status": 200, "error": null, "attempts": 1, "latency_ms": 2829.8, "n_results": 10, "results": [{"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "Ozmosi | IBI-3001 Drug Profile", "url": "https://pryzm.ozmosi.com/product/32752", "domain": "pryzm.ozmosi.com", "snippet": "IBI3001 is a potentially first-in-class bispecific ADC against B7-H3 and EGFR that is site-specifically glycan-conjugated using the clinically validated SYNtecanE® platform.\nIBI3001 has multiple anti-tumor mechanisms of action: (1) enhanced EGFR signaling blockade; (2) EGFR- and B7-H3-aided payload internalization and cytotoxicity; and (3) potent bystander killing effects of ADC.\nThe optimized B7-H3 arm not only enhances the EGFR signaling blockade but also reduces EGFR on-target toxicities.\nIBI3001 showed strong anti-tumor efficacy in vitro and in vivo across multiple solid tumors and is well tolerated with the therapeutic index at 40.\n...\nMechanisms of Action: B7-H3 Antagonist,EGFR Inhibitor\n...\nRoute of Administration: Intravenous\nFDA Designation: *\nApproval Status: Not Approved\n...\n|06/30/2025|News Article|Innovent Biologics Showcases \"Dual Innovations\" at Oncology R&D Day, Pioneering the Future of Cancer Treatment with Next-Generation IO and ADC Platforms|", "date": "2025-06-30", "last_updated": "2025-07-03"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "Error 403 - This web app is stopped.", "url": "https://investor.innoventbio.com/media/1062/%E6%8B%9B%E8%82%A1%E4%B9%A6%E8%8B%B1%E6%96%87.pdf", "domain": "investor.innoventbio.com", "snippet": "If you are the web app administrator, please find the common 403 error scenarios and resolution here.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2025-01-15"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "Therapy Detail", "url": "https://ckb.genomenon.com/therapy/show/16766", "domain": "ckb.genomenon.com", "snippet": "|Therapy Description|IBI3001 is an antibody-drug conjugate (ADC) comprising a bispecific antibody targeting CD276 (B7-H3) and EGFR linked to Exatecan, which potentially decreases tumor growth (Cancer Res (2024) 84 (7_Supplement): LB055).|\n...\n|NCT06349408|Phase Ib/II|IBI3001|IBI3001 in Participants With Unresectable, Locally Advanced or Metastatic Solid Tumors|Recruiting|AUS|1|", "date": "2024-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-06-20"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "IBI-3001 - Drug Targets, Indications, Patents", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/drug/5ee8502f51104aa1a802b2eafa6d1a3c", "domain": "synapse.patsnap.com", "snippet": "|Target CD276 x EGFR x Top I|\n|Action inhibitors, antagonists|\n|Mechanism CD276 inhibitors(CD276 antigen inhibitors), EGFR antagonists(Epidermal growth factor receptor erbB1 antagonists), TOP1 inhibitors(DNA topoisomerase I inhibitors)|\n...\n|Active Indication Locally Advanced Malignant Solid Neoplasm|", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-05-01"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "P123706_Inhibrx Presentation_May 2026 Public Website", "url": "https://inhibrx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Inhibrx-Investor-Presentation_Sept-2026.pdf", "domain": "inhibrx.com", "snippet": "Set to pursue a breakthrough pathway in 1L R/M HPV+ CPS ≥1 HNSCC\n...\nHNSCC", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-10"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "File Unavailable", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1420720/000142072022000022/ibio-20220512xex99d1.htm", "domain": "sec.gov", "snippet": "# This page is temporarily unav