n...\nNCT03977480\nTerminated\nPhase 2\nA Multicenter, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo Parallel Controlled Clinical Study on the Effecacy and Safety of Different Dosing Regimens of Hemay007 in Patients With Active Ulcerative Colitis\nThis study adopts a multicenter, randomized, double-blind, low-medium-high dose group and placebo parallel controlled clinical study design.\n...\nA multicenter, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical study on the efficacy and safety of different dosing regimens of Hemay007 in patients with active ulcerative colitis\n...\nChina\nTianjin Hemay Pharmaceutical Technology Co., Ltd.\n13 Aug 2019", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-08-30"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "Hemay007: TNF-alpha, Phase 2 in Ulcerative Colitis", "url": "https://assetmemo.bio/drug/hemay007", "domain": "assetmemo.bio", "snippet": "Discontinuedsponsor decision\n...\nDiscontinued, for reasons the sponsor has not stated\nHemay007 is Tianjin Hemay's oral candidate.\nIts only ulcerative colitis study, the Phase 2 NCT03977480, is TERMINATED on ClinicalTrials.gov for failure to recruit.\nScoped to the ulcerative colitis market only: the molecule continued elsewhere, with a Phase 2 rheumatoid arthritis study (NCT05247216) completed and last updated 2024-03, and no Crohn's disease study was ever registered.\n...\nAlso in development:Crohn's Disease · Phase 1\n...\n|Hemay007 — this drug|Phase 2|Small molecule|TNF-alpha| | |", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-21"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "Table 1.", "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12952356/table/T1/", "domain": "pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov", "snippet": "|TNF modulator|Hemay007|Small molecule TNF-α regulator|NCT03977480|Phase 2|Terminated early Aug 2022 due to recruitment difficulties|", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-03-14"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "Xiajiang Hemei Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd.", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/organization/