 \n< 75yrs  16mg \n>/=75yrs  8mg \nIV \n15 min \nIn 50ml sodium chloride 0.9% \n30 minutes prior to paclitaxel \n \n \nPACLITAXEL  \n \n \n200mg/m² \n \n \nIV \n \nOver 3\nhours \nDiluted in 500ml sodium chloride 0.9% \n(non PVC) \nVia in-line 0.22micron filter \nDoses <150mg in 250ml 0.9% sodium \nchloride \n \nCARBOPLATIN \n(AUC 6) \nDose = AUC X\n(GFR + 25)  \n(max 700mg) \n \nIV \n \n30min \n500ml glucose 5% \n \n*From 3rd infusion dexamethasone maybe reduced to 12mg IV \nTTO \nDrug \nDose \nRoute \nDirections \nDay \n1 \nDexamethasone\n6mg \nPO \nOD for 3 days starting on day 2.  \n \n \nMetoclopramide  \n \n \n10mg \n \n \nPO \nUp to 3 times a day as required.  \n(max. 30mg per day including 20mg pre-chemo \ndose) Do not take for more than 5 days \ncontinuously.\n\n…\n\nDay \nDrug \nDose \nRoute \nInfusion \nDuration \nAdministration \n1 \n \nMetoclopramide \n \n20mg \n \nPO \n \n \n \nstat \n \n \nPEMBROLIZUMAB \n \n \n200mg \n \n \nIV \n \n \n30min \nIn 100ml Sodium Chloride 0.9% via in-line\n\n…\n\n(max. 30mg per day including 20mg pre-chemo \ndose) Do not take for more than 5 days \ncontinuously. \n \n \nRepeat every 42 days (alternative dosing schedule): \n \nDay \nDrug \nDose \nRoute \nInfusion \nDuration \nAdministration \n1 \n \nMetoclopramide\n20mg \n \nPO \n \n \n \nstat \n \n \nPEMBROLIZUMAB \n \n \n400mg \n \n \nIV \n \n \n30min \nIn 100ml Sodium Chloride 0.9% via in-line \nlow- protein binding 0.22 microns filter. \nFlush the line with sodium chloride 0.9%", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-05-05"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "���������", "url": "https://cdn.clinicaltrials.gov/large-docs/61/NCT05508061/SAP_001.pdf", "domain": "cdn.clinicaltrials.gov", "snippet": "������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n���������������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n���������������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n�