n vivo therapy approach was carried out with HNSCC16 P1 M1.\n...\nIn an in vivo trial, drug response against Cisplatin was examined and HNSCC16 M1 P1 was chosen as experimental model, due to the comparably fast and reliable in vivo growth kinetics (Figure 4B).", "date": "2022-05-18", "last_updated": "2025-10-23"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "Original article Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma ...", "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1879729619300961", "domain": "sciencedirect.com", "snippet": "You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2025-09-29"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "Targeted therapy for head and neck cancer: signaling pathways and clinical studies", "url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41392-022-01297-0", "domain": "nature.com", "snippet": "257 GW2016 is an effective inhibitor of the ErbB-2 and EGFR tyrosine kinase domains that is undergoing development.", "date": "2023-01-16", "last_updated": "2023-01-16"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "Immunotherapy in head and neck squamous cell carcinoma", "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S246829422200140X", "domain": "sciencedirect.com", "snippet": "You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2025-09-26"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "Therapeutic approaches for the treatment of head and neck ... - PMC", "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9046875/", "domain": "pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov", "snippet": "To date, cetuximab as an adjunct to platinum/5-FU, and, nivolumab monotherapy have responded to achieve significantly longer OS as compared to their respective control arms [68].", "date": "2022-04-20", "last_updated": "2026-08-25"}, {"rank": 10, "query_index": null, "title": "[PDF] Download PDF - eScholarship.org", "url": "https://escholarship.org/content/qt146342j0/qt146342j0.pdf", "domain": "escholarship.org", "snippet": "palpable (generally 5–7 d post-inoculation) with low doses of cetuximab (0.4 mg weekly dosed as\n0.2 mg twice per week) with the rationale that \ntreating smaller tumors with lower doses of cetux- imab would facilitate the selection of resistant tumor cells.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-07-10"}], "raw": {"id": "de81abc4-1fb0-4469-8965-03f93d36d986"}, "ts": "2026-10-03T12:41:46+00:00"}
{"row_id": "q054", "objective": "DWP216 in vivo animal models and results: cell-line xenograft (CDX), patient-derived xenograft (PDX), syngeneic, orthotopic, or genetically engineered models", "anchors": ["DWP216"], "mode": "queries", "case_id": "q054-2", "query": "DWP216 NCI-H1373 monotherapy tumour volume", "repeat": 0, "provider": "perplexity", "request": {"query": "DWP216 NCI-H1373 monotherapy tumour volume", "search_type": "fast", "max_results": 10}, "ok": true, "status": 200, "error": null, "attempts": 1, "latency_ms": 490.1, "n_results": 10, "results": [{"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "PDC000198 - Proteomic Data Commons - National Cancer Institute", "url": "https://proteomic.datacommons.cancer.gov/pdc/study/PDC000198", "domain": "proteomic.datacommons.cancer.gov", "snippet": "This warning banner provides privacy and security notices consistent with applicable federal laws, directives, and other federal guidance for accessing this Government system, which includes (1) this computer network, (2) all computers connected to this network, and (3) all devices and storage media attached to this network or to a computer on this network.\nThis system is provided for Government-authorized use only.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-22"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "NCI-H1373 [H1373] - CRL-5866", "url": "https://www.atcc.org/500-error-page?aspxerrorpath=/products/crl-5866", "domain": "atcc.org", "snippet": "Please include:\n...\n- the URL you were trying to reach\n...\n+1-703-365-2700", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-21"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "NCI-H1373 AdagR", "url": "https://ribometrix.com/app/uploads/2024/09/ESMO2024Poster_Final.pdf", "domain": "ribometrix.com", "snippet": "Importantly, RBX-6610 monotherapy in vivo causes significant tumor growth inhibition, and the combination therapy with sotorasib results in significant tumor regression in a naïve NSCLC xenograft model.", "date": null, "last_updated": "