{"row_id": "q062", "objective": "HDM-3018 sponsor Huadong Medicine Co. Ltd., development stage Preclinical, and indication Inflammatory Bowel Disease", "anchors": ["HDM-3018"], "mode": "queries", "case_id": "q062-3", "query": "HDM-3018 inflammatory bowel disease indication", "repeat": 0, "provider": "perplexity", "request": {"query": "HDM-3018 inflammatory bowel disease indication", "search_type": "fast", "max_results": 10}, "ok": true, "status": 200, "error": null, "attempts": 1, "latency_ms": 26036.7, "n_results": 10, "results": [{"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "HDM3018 - Drug Targets, Indications, Patents - Synapse", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/drug/ec96b3573d7243f68cb87561b892a60f", "domain": "synapse.patsnap.com", "snippet": "+ [1]\nActive Indication\nArthritis, Psoriatic\nInflammatory Bowel Diseases\nPsoriasis of scalp\n...\nInflammatory Bowel Diseases\nPreclinical\nChina\nHuadong Medicine Co., Ltd.\n20 Aug 2025", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-04-12"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "register", "url": "https://academic.oup.com/my-account/register?siteId=6136&returnUrl=https://academic.oup.com/ibdjournal/article/30/12/2512/7588761", "domain": "academic.oup.com", "snippet": "For full access to this pdf, sign in to an existing account, or purchase an annual subscription.", "date": "2025-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-10-29"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "Graphical Abstract", "url": "https://academic.oup.com/view-large/figure/569042625/izag138f7.tif?itm_medium=graphical+abstract+image&itm_content=open+image&itm_source=http://academic.oup.com/ibdjournal/article-abstract/32/8/1547/8725974&itm_campaign=graphical+abstract", "domain": "academic.oup.com", "snippet": "Graphical Abstract | Oxford Academic \nGraphical Abstract\n...\nPlease sign in to your personal account to gift article access.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-08-04"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "Digestive enzyme – Knowledge and References", "url": "https://taylorandfrancis.com/knowledge/Medicine_and_healthcare/Physiology/Digestive_enzyme/", "domain": "taylorandfrancis.com", "snippet": "Previous reports indicate that HDM is detected in the intestinal samples [3].\nOur recent studies also found that HDM-derived enolase protein induced neutrophilic inflammation in the mouse intestine [19].\nThe present data show that HDM also can be detected in the stool of both UC patients and NC subjects.\n...\nThe event that HDM isolated from stool samples can be detected by Western blotting and ELISA demonstrate the bio activity of HDM.\nThere are numerous immune cells in the colon tract.\nHDM can come into contact with immune cells to induce immune inflammation in the colon [3,19,20].\n...\nBy exposing to HDM in the culture or in the colon, Eos were activated by HDM, and released inflammatory mediators, MBP and ECP.\nAs such, future studies may focus on the removal of HDM from the intestinal tract to reduce HDM-related inflammation in local tissues.\nThis may be beneficial for patients sensitized to HDM, or/and prevent the development of HDM-specific immune inflammation [20].", "date": "2019-09-01", "last_updated": "2025-10-18"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "Study Details Page", "url": "https://www.abbvieclinicaltrials.com/study/?id=DE038", "domain": "abbvieclinicaltrials.com", "snippet": "AbbVie Clinical Trials is designed to support, inform, and help patients in a clinical study or those who are interested in participating.", "date": "2024-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-03-19"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "US20250243280A1 - Methods of treating gastrointestinal ...", "url": "https://patents.google.com/patent/US20250243280A1/en", "domain": "patents.google.com", "snippet": "ents, the second injectable liquid formulation is suitable for administration as a single injection or multiple injections.\n- the disease is an inflammatory bowel disease.\n- the inflammatory bowel disease is Crohn'